    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const themeId = $json.themeId || \"blue\";\nconst count = $json.count || 1;\n\nconst jobId = new Date().toISOString().replace(/[-:.TZ]/g, \"\").slice(0, 14);\nconst cta = \"For more free BCBA mock exams, visit bcbamockexam.com.\";\n\nreturn [{\n  json: { themeId, count, jobId, cta }\n}];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -800,
        96
      ],
      "id": "2a505766-67db-46d0-aa29-94b201e996b4",
      "name": "Code in JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Randomly generate exactly ONE NEW BCBA 6th edition style multiple-choice question.\n\nTopic constraint (must follow):\n\nYou MUST follow the domain-selection step in the system message (A–I, weighted).\n\nThe question must be clearly aligned to the chosen domain and NOT drift to another domain.\n\nVariety constraints:\n\nDo NOT repeatedly use the same core concept words (e.g., “reinforcement”, “extinction”, “DRA”) across consecutive outputs.\n\nIf you notice your draft resembles common templates you used recently, regenerate a different scenario, behavior, setting, and terminology.\n\nFormat constraints:\n\nquestion <= 300 characters\n\neach option <= 80 characters\n\nexactly 4 options with keys A,B,C,D\n\ndo NOT reveal the correct answer\n\nOutput ONLY strict JSON matching exactly:\n{\"question\":\"...\",\"options\":{\"A\":\"...\",\"B\":\"...\",\"C\":\"...\",\"D\":\"...\"}}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a strict JSON-only generator. Output MUST be exactly ONE valid JSON object and NOTHING else.\nNo markdown, no preface, no explanations, no extra keys.\nResponse must start with \"{\" and end with \"}\".\nSchema MUST be exactly: {\"question\":\"...\",\"options\":{\"A\":\"...\",\"B\":\"...\",\"C\":\"...\",\"D\":\"...\"}}\n\nInternal planning rule (do not output):\n\nFirst randomly select exactly ONE domain from A–I using the weights:\nA 5%, B 14%, C 12%, D 7%, E 13%, F 13%, G 14%, H 11%, I 11%.\n\nThen generate a question that clearly belongs to the selected domain.\n\nAvoid overusing the same domain: if your selected domain matches the most recent domain you used in this conversation/session, reselect a different domain.\n\nSelf-check before output (do not print):\n\nquestion length <= 300 characters\n\neach option length <= 80 characters\n\noptions keys are exactly A,B,C,D\n\ndo NOT reveal or hint the correct answer\n\nvalid JSON with proper escaping\nIf any rule fails, regenerate internally until all rules pass."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -576,
        96
      ],
      "id": "d0ec7f1c-4fe5-4501-9e05-04bd96c387f3",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"question\", \"options\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"question\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 300 },\n    \"options\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"A\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 80 },\n        \"B\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 80 },\n        \"C\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 80 },\n        \"D\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 80 }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -432,
        320
      ],
      "id": "8578f72b-dc3d-4484-a59e-cc0256e1f422",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 兼容不同 Agent 输出字段\nconst raw =\n  $json.output ||\n  $json.text ||\n  $json.response ||\n  $json.result ||\n  $json;\n\nconst s = typeof raw === \"string\" ? raw : JSON.stringify(raw);\n\n// 抓 JSON 段\nconst i = s.indexOf(\"{\");\nconst j = s.lastIndexOf(\"}\");\nif (i < 0 || j < 0) throw new Error(\"Model did not return JSON\");\n\nconst data = JSON.parse(s.slice(i, j + 1));\n\nconst question = (data.question || \"\").trim();\nconst A = (data.options?.A || \"\").trim();\nconst B = (data.options?.B || \"\").trim();\nconst C = (data.options?.C || \"\").trim();\nconst D = (data.options?.D || \"\").trim();\n\n// 拼你 renderer 需要的 questionBlock\nconst questionBlock =\n  `${question}\\n` +\n  `A. ${A}\\n` +\n  `B. ${B}\\n` +\n  `C. ${C}\\n` +\n  `D. ${D}`;\n\n// 拼 TTS 脚本（不读答案）\nconst cta = $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.cta;\nconst voiceScript =\n  `Question. ${question}. ` +\n  `Option A. ${A}. ` +\n  `Option B. ${B}. ` +\n  `Option C. ${C}. ` +\n  `Option D. ${D}. ` +\n  `${cta}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...$json,\n    questionBlock,\n    voiceScript,\n  }\n}];\n"
      },
